<description>
<![CDATA[ <p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Position: </strong>Arborist</p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Location:</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;Troy, AL</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Pay:</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;$</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">18 to $23</span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">/hour</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Experience:&nbsp;</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;</span></p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">2 years of experience operating bucket trucks and aerial lift equipment.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Previous work with a ROW company or residential tree service strongly preferred.</span></li></ol><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Type:&nbsp;</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Full-time; Contract&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Schedule:</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;Monday - Friday, 7:00am to 4:00pm</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Clark Personnel&nbsp;</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">is seeking&nbsp;a </span><strong>Arborist</strong><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;"> </strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">to&nbsp;join a growing and dynamic team!&nbsp;This role is responsible for operating a 65-foot bucket truck, performing tree trimming and removal tasks, and using specialized equipment such as hydraulic speed‑saws. The ideal candidate will have prior experience in right‑of‑way (ROW) vegetation management or residential tree service.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Job Description:</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Safely operate a bucket truck for daily tree trimming and removal activities.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Operate a 65’ aerial bucket to access trees at various heights.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Utilize a hydraulic speed‑saw and other trimming equipment with precision and care.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Perform tree pruning, removal, and debris cleanup.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Inspect and maintain equipment, reporting any issues immediately.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Follow all right‑of‑way vegetation management regulations and safety protocols.</span></li></ol><p><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Position Requirements:&nbsp;</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Valid driver’s license required (CDL preferred but not mandatory unless specified).</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Ability to safely operate saws, hydraulic tools, and trimming equipment.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Physical ability to lift, climb, and work outdoors in varying weather conditions.</span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Strong commitment to safety and teamwork. </span></li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Excellent communication skills. </span></li></ol><p><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">Clark Personnel&nbsp;</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">is part of</span><strong style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;Array Corporation,</strong><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;the leading technology-enabled workforce solutions company whose mission is to fix how work is bought,&nbsp;sold&nbsp;and delivered to enable access to the American Dream.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;</span></p><p><em style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin,&nbsp;disability&nbsp;or veteran status.</em><span style="color: rgb(13, 13, 13); background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;</span></p> ]]>
